 ["Adolescence is the stage between childhood and adulthood, roughly ages 11 to 19. Hormones, which are chemical messengers, cause changes in body and mood.","Boys' voices deepen and girls and boys grow taller. These changes are natural and happen at different times for different people.","Good habits help: balanced food, sleep, exercise, daily bath and talking to a trusted adult."],
